            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "subheading": "",
            "description": "<p><strong>Max Biocare — Trusted Australian Brand for Over 25 Years</strong>​</p><p>At Max Biocare, science and care go hand in hand. For more than two decades, we’ve been dedicated to developing evidence-based health solutions that people can truly rely on. Every product is grounded in rigorous research, many with their own clinical trials, and guided by leading health professionals worldwide.​</p><p>Our commitment is simple: to deliver safe, effective, and high-quality products that make a real difference in everyday health and wellbeing. With Max Biocare, you can feel confident that your health is supported by expertise, integrity, and innovation.​</p>",
            "description_size": "text-sm",
            "enable_collapsible": true,
