        },
        "tab_zHqhU3": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "navigation_title": "Innovation & Science​",
            "tab_content": "<h4><strong>Innovation & Science</strong></h4><p>We believe science and innovation should make a real difference to people’s lives. Through the Max Biocare Institute, we lead clinical research and global collaborations to ensure our products are safe, effective, and evidence-based.​</p><p>Our studies meet the highest ethical and regulatory standards, with findings published in peer-reviewed journals — helping to share knowledge and improve public health worldwide.​</p><p>To learn more, visit: <a href=\"https://www.maxbiocare.com/innovation-science/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">https://www.maxbiocare.com/innovation-science/</span></a></p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
