        "tab_NM6yLa": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "navigation_title": "Clinical Trials",
            "tab_content": "<h4><strong>Clinical Trials</strong>​</h4><p>Many of our products have been evaluated in clinical studies across a wide range of health areas. Each trial is conducted to the highest clinical and regulatory standards, led by experienced researchers to ensure outcomes are not only reliable, but also meaningful for real-world health and wellbeing.​</p><p>For more information on our ongoing clinical trials, visit: <a href=\"https://www.maxbiocare.com/clinical-trials/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">https://www.maxbiocare.com/clinical-trials/</span></a></p>",
