        "tab_4kbKR7": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "navigation_title": "Sustainability",
            "tab_content": "<h4><strong>Max Biocare Research Parks & Sustainability</strong></h4><p>​Where science and nature come together. With two dedicated sites in regional Victoria, our Research Parks pioneer natural ingredient innovation and development. Guided by a circular economy approach, we recycle resources, minimise waste, and regenerate ecosystems — ensuring that every initiative supports sustainability, while creating products that care for both people and the planet.​</p><p>Read more about our Research Parks here: <a href=\"https://www.maxbiocare.com/max-biocare-research-parks/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">https://www.maxbiocare.com/max-biocare-research-parks/</span></a></p>",
